"None\n\nTo implement a minimal fuzzy library for fuzzy testing, we'll need to import the necessary libraries and define the required functions. Here's a basic implementation:\n\n```python\nimport random\nimport time\nimport os\nfrom fuzzywuzzy import fuzz\nfrom fuzzywuzzy import process\n\ndef generate_test_case(target, min_similarity=50):\n    \"\"\"Generate a test case with a random string containing the target string.\"\"\"\n    target_str = ''.join(random.choices(target, k=10))\n    return target_str\n\ndef execute_test(case, func):\n    \"\"\"Execute a test function with the given test case.\"\"\"\n    start_time = time.time()\n    result = func(case)\n    end_time = time.time()\n    print(f\"Test case: {case}\")\n    print(f\"Result: {result}\")\n    print(f\"Execution time: {end_time - start_time} seconds\")\n\ndef report_results(tests):\n    \"\"\"Report test results with average similarity and execution time.\"\"\"\n    total_similarity = 0\n    total_time = 0\n    for test in tests:\n        similarity = fuzz.ratio(test, generate_test_case(test))\n        total_similarity += similarity\n        total_time += time.time() - test.start_time\n    avg_similarity = total_similarity / len(tests)\n    avg_time = total_time / len(tests)\n    print(f\"Test results:\")\n    for test in tests:\n        print(f\"  - Test case: {test}\")\n        print(f\"    - Average similarity: {avg_similarity:.2f}%\")\n        print(f\"    - Execution time: {avg_time:.2f} seconds\")\n    print(f\"  - Average similarity: {avg_similarity:.2f}%\")\n    print(f\"  - Average execution time: {avg_time:.2f} seconds\")\n```\n\nIn this implementation, the `generate_test_case` function generates a random test case with a target string of a specified length. The `execute_test` function executes a given test function with the generated test case. The `report_results` function calculates the average similarity and execution time of all tests and prints the results.\n\nNote that this is a very basic implementation and may not cover all edge cases or provide accurate results. You may need to modify and extend this code to suit your specific requirements."
